p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n  \"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=104 valign=top style='width:77.8pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:13.0pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=80 valign=top style='width:60.35pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:13.0pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=222 valign=top style='width:166.45pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:13.0pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n<\/table>\r\n\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><u><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>T3:<\/span><\/u><\/b><b><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'> <\/span><\/b><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>The\r\nhuman thyroid gland is a major component of the endocrine system. Thyroid\r\nhormones perform many important functions. They exert powerful and essential\r\nregulatory influences on growth, differentiation, cellular metabolism and\r\ngeneral hormonal balance of the body, as well as on the maintenance of\r\nmetabolic activity and the development of the skeletal and organ system.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>The determination\r\nof T3 levels in serum is essential in assessing thyroid functions. In most\r\nhyperthyroid patients, both serum T3 &amp; T4 are elevated. However a condition\r\nknown as T3 thyrotoxicosis exhibits only elevated T3 concentrations. Serum T3\r\nlevels are also an excellent indicator of the effectiveness of thyroid therapy.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><u><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>T4:<\/span><\/u><\/b><b><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\u00a0 <\/span><\/b><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Thyroxine\r\nhormone is secreted in the thyroid gland which is the most important component\r\nof the endocrine system. Over 99% thyroxine secreted in the blood is bound to\r\nThyroxine Binding Globulin (TBG), albumin and pre-albumin. The total Thyroxine\r\n(T4) content in blood is important in detecting thyroid disorders. In\r\nhyperthyroidism, like in those with Grave\u2019s disease, the T4 level is increased\r\nin blood, while in hypothyroidism, like in those with myxedema, the T4 level is\r\ndecreased. <b>\u00a0<\/b>\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:8.0pt'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:8.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Clinical correlation is suggested. <\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Lisa Scan-EM (Semi-Automated Clinical ELISA\r\nAnalyzer)<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>OUT SIDE SAMPLE<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<\/div>","page":{"size":"595.45pt 841.7pt","margin":"148.5pt 36.0pt 72.0pt 36.0pt"}}